<h2 class="mt-12">Implementation order for a product care program</h2>
<ol>
<li>Record product care permission origins in the ESP before sending.</li>
<li>Verify relevant order, delivery, refund, permission and case events with controlled test records, including delayed and replayed events.</li>
<li>Write product care suppression and exits before any product care flow exists.</li>
<li>For product care, start single-journey with a control group.</li>
<li>At day thirty, review product care margin, complaints, unsubscribes, repeat buying.</li>
<li>Scale product care only once a second operator edits safely.</li>
<li>Product Care peak policy locks edits, codes, cadence.</li>
<li>Reprice product care totals against margin every quarter.</li>
<li>Retire or trim product care flows untouched for ninety days.</li>
</ol>
